        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "These impact opportunity areas are derived from the UN Sustainable Development Goals (“SDGs”) and have been identified through a multi-pronged process to align the top needs of our stakeholders, the issues that are most important to our business, and the areas we are best placed to accelerate positive impact at scale.",
        "start_character": 20668,
        "end_character": 20987
      },
      {
