        "accession_number": "0000769397-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To keep pace with these changes, we maintain a vigorous program of new product development to address demands in the marketplace for our products, such as enabling convergence, more flexibility and sustainable outcomes.",
